### 环境变量配置
@authUrl = http://localhost:8081
@accountUrl = http://localhost:8082
@transferHost = http://localhost:8083
@testAccountNo = AU-123456789

### 1. 先调用 auth-service (8081) 登录并捕获 Token
POST {{authUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tom",
  "password": "tom123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("authToken", response.body.token);
%}

### 2. 再调用 account-service (8082) 查询余额
GET {{accountUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/{{testAccountNo}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. 账户入账 / 充值 (POST Credit)
# 对应 AccountController 的 creditAccount 方法
POST {{accountUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/credit
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNo": "{{testAccountNo}}",
  "amount": 2500.50
}

### 4. 发起转账交易 (Transfer Service -> 扣款 + 投递 IBM MQ)
# @name transfer
POST {{transferHost}}/api/v1/payments/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderAccount": "{{    testAccountNo}}",
  "receiverAccount": "AU87654321",
  "amount": 25.00,
  "currency": "NZD"
}
